OL,3,AUS strikes Iran ahead of midterm
OL,4,Aelections
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe US has launched strikes on Iran's
OL,7,FQeshm Island in the Strait of Hormuz,
OL,8,FUS officials have told CBS, the BBC's
OL,9,FUS partner.
OL,11,FIranian state news agency IRNA reported
OL,12,Fseveral explosions on the island on
OL,13,FMonday.
OL,15,FThe US officials described the strikes
OL,16,Fas limited and said they were in
OL,17,Fresponse to Iran's Islamic
OL,18,FRevolutionary Guard Corps (IRGC) firing
OL,19,Fupon a US aircraft.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,313,300,200,140,0,100
